---
/** Lays FlipCards side by side in a post within the reading width (three fit; the cards tighten to suit); stacks them on phones. */
---

<div class="flip-row not-prose"><slot /></div>

<style>
  .flip-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(12.5rem, 1fr));
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: stretch; /* one height per row, flipped or not */
  }
</style>
